OVERVIEW
This directory contains the E4D (https://e4d.pnl.gov) input files used to invert time-lapse ERT data collected during shear stimulation attempts on the 4100 level testbed. The shear stimulation attempts were conducted from March 23 through March 25 of 2022. Descriptions of the tests including flow and pressure monitoring data are available at:

Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory. (2023). EGS Collab Experiment 2: Hydraulic Pressure Test Results [data set]. Retrieved from https://dx.doi.org/10.15121/1988394.

FILE DESCRIPTIONS
     E4D Mesh Files
     	 -exp2d.1.ele:   tetgen element file
	 -exp2d.1.node:	 tetgen node file
	 -exp2d.1.neigh: tetgen neighbore file
	 -exp2d.1.face:  tetgen face file
	 -exp2d.1.edge:  tetgen edge file
	 -epp2d.trn:     E4D mesh translation file
	 
      E4D Options Files	 
 	 -exp2.inv: 	 baseline inversion options file
	 -exp2_tl.inv:   time-lapse inversion options file
	 -exp2.out: 	 output options file
	 -e4d.inp:	 input options file
	 